00:06:12.459 --> 00:06:15.267
<v Host>Quiz time. Listen and answer.

00:06:15.867 --> 00:06:19.420
<v Slow>列車は何両ですか。

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.091
<v Host>Four cars.

00:06:22.692 --> 00:06:28.836
<v Slow>4両目では、何を楽しむことができますか。

00:06:29.636 --> 00:06:31.891
<v Host>Tea, in a tatami room.

00:06:32.492 --> 00:06:36.932
<v Slow>2両目には、何がありますか。

00:06:37.732 --> 00:06:39.603
<v Host>A piano.

00:06:40.204 --> 00:06:44.812
<v Slow>列車は、いつから走りますか。

00:06:45.612 --> 00:06:47.651
<v Host>From February next year.

00:06:48.252 --> 00:06:54.851
<v Slow>昼ご飯が付いた切符は、大人1人いくらですか。

00:06:55.651 --> 00:06:57.644
<v Host>Thirty-nine thousand yen.

00:06:58.244 --> 00:07:02.540
<v Host>That's all for today. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:07:03.139 --> 00:07:05.540
<v News>また明日。
